DreamPassSettings:LayerNames {
    at    Source/DreamShaderPass/Public/DreamPassSettings.h#DreamPassSettings:LayerNames
    src   "The pass layers, at most 32: a UDreamPassLayerComponent gives primitives some of them, and a mesh pass's\n`Filter = Layer(Name)` selects the primitives that have one. The order is the bit order; renaming one is safe,\nmoving one re-targets every compiled pipeline that names it until those are compiled again."
}

